mport AbstractHolidayCalendar, Holiday\n\nclass HolidayCalendar(AbstractHolidayCalendar):\n    def __init__(self, rules):\n        self.rules = list(np.atleast_1d(rules))\n\njan1 = HolidayCalendar(Holiday('jan1', year=2015, month=1, day=1))\njan2 = HolidayCalendar(Holiday('jan2', year=2015, month=1, day=2))\n\n\njan1.holidays()\nOut[2]: \n<class 'pandas.tseries.index.DatetimeIndex'>\n[2015-01-01]\nLength: 1, Freq: None, Timezone: None\n\njan2.holidays()\nOut[3]: \n<class 'pandas.tseries.index.DatetimeIndex'>\n[2015-01-01]    <--------------------------- uses cached result from *other* instance!\nLength: 1, Freq: None, Timezone: None\n```\n\n``` python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom pandas.tseries.holiday import AbstractHolidayCalendar, Holiday\n\nclass HolidayCalendar(AbstractHolidayCalendar):\n    def __init__(self, rules):\n        self.rules = list(np.atleast_1d(rules))\n\njan1 = HolidayCalendar(Holiday('jan1', year=2015, month=1, day=1))\njan2 = HolidayCalendar(Holiday('jan2', year=2015, month=1, day=2))\n\n\njan2.holidays()\nOut[2]: \n<class 'pandas.tseries.index.DatetimeIndex'>\n[2015-01-02]\nLength: 1, Freq: None, Timezone: None\n\njan1.holidays()\nOut[3]: \n<class 'pandas.tseries.index.DatetimeIndex'>\n[2015-01-02]    <--------------------------- uses cached result from *other* instance!\nLength: 1, Freq: None, Timezone: None\n```\n\nhttps://github.com/pydata/pandas/blob/a72d95163b4d268012709255d7a52bbe5c1a7eb6/pandas/tseries/holiday.py#L351-L357\n","closed_by":{"login":"jreback","id":953992,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Mzk5Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/953992?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jreback","html_url":"https://github.com/jreback","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jreback/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jreback/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jreback/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jreback/starred{/owner}{/